  "translation": "Elisha a dutše ntleng ya gagwe, gomme bagolo ba dutše ⟨את⟩ naye; gomme kgoši a romela motho go tšwa pele ga yena; eupša pele moromiwa a fihla go yena, yena a re go bagolo: A le bone gore morwa wa mpolai yo o rometše go ntšha ⟨את⟩ hlogo ya ka? Lebelelang, ge moromiwa a fihla, tswalelang ⟨את⟩ lebati, gomme la ⟨את⟩ mo gata ka lebati. A ga go lentšu la maoto a mong wa yena ka morago ga yena?",
